.TH ferry-localsend-text 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-localsend\-text \- Send a text or a link to a LocalSend app, which shows it as a message
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry localsend text\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-\-pin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-to\fR> [\fITEXT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Send a text or a link to a LocalSend app, which shows it as a message
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TO>\fR
Name or IP address of the LocalSend app, as listed by `ferry localsend scan`
.TP
\fB\-\-pin\fR \fI<PIN>\fR
PIN, for apps that require one
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fITEXT\fR]
Text to send (default: read from standard input)
